{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>各位蛋糕愛好者注意！Italian Tomato Cafe宣布推出超具話題性蛋糕放題，成人每位$138（小童$98）可以限時90分鐘任食件裝蛋糕（$52 或以下之件裝蛋糕），仲送飲品一杯。蛋糕放題憑星期一至四全日供應，快啲約FD去食甜品狂歡！</p><p>Italian Tomato新推蛋糕放題！</p><p>蛋糕放題可以任食多款Italian Tomato人氣新品蛋糕款式，包括最近大熱的海鹽焦糖香蕉朱古力撻、全新西瓜青提蛋糕，以及經典皇牌士多啤梨蛋糕、日式栗子蛋糕、芒果焦糖脆脆朱古力蛋糕等，保證各位甜品控一定超滿足！</p><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p><figure><img alt=\"Italian Tomato (圖片來源：官方圖)\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179015041945176222_19594108736ab38713a41df.jpg\"/><figcaption>Italian Tomato (圖片來源：官方圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Italian Tomato (圖片來源：官方圖)\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179015042105061237_7457234116ab3871541cf3.jpg\"/><figcaption>Italian Tomato (圖片來源：官方圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Italian Tomato (圖片來源：官方圖)\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179015042321053256_12407192536ab387176246a.jpg\"/><figcaption>Italian Tomato (圖片來源：官方圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Italian Tomato (圖片來源：官方圖)\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179015042462786058_2983163036ab38718ce826.jpg\"/><figcaption>Italian Tomato (圖片來源：官方圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Italian Tomato (圖片來源：官方圖)\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179015042609665319_3871409776ab3871a8e4d1.jpg\"/><figcaption>Italian Tomato (圖片來源：官方圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Italian Tomato (圖片來源：官方圖)\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179015042802230705_4291254236ab3871c37b26.jpg\"/><figcaption>Italian Tomato (圖片來源：官方圖)</figcaption></figure><p>名稱：Italian Tomato Cafe</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T08:21:18.010146+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":488,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}